{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Landomayzer&quot; is a first-person adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035130/extras/afd2a206923fb7200495e9348f364363.avif?t=1768175003\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have been chosen by the \u201cQueen.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether by design or by chance, I must swiftly complete the tasks given to me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city we live in is ruled by the \u201cQueen,\u201d and her orders are absolute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From this moment, I must fulfill my role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035130/extras/a8ac3ef43444b713a85e8c07f4a69225.avif?t=1768175003\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator where various events unfold as you move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine objects to progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no in-game text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quest markers or time limits \u2014 you can play at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wherever the \u201cQueen\u201d is, there is always a \u201cQueen Candidate\u201d nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After clearing the game for the first time, a version with added cutscenes and objects will be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 20\u201360 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Streaming Guidelines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is allowed without prior permission, both for individuals and companies.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/40351